{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1365819-automatic-weapons-and-spray","id":1365819,"title":"Automatic weapons and Spray?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-06T12:56:25-08:00","id":1365819,"title":"Automatic weapons and Spray?","content":"Hello all, I had some questions on weapon tags for my upcoming Aeon game?<br /> <br /> 1) I was just wondering but am I missing anything or shouldn't automatic weapons also be able to do the Spray stunt? This just seems an odd oversight by the core book? I am saying this as someone who has operated a large number of fully automatic weapons in the US army?<br /> <br /> 2) The Quality Tag and Laser Carbines, is this already added in or are they actually 3 enhancement?<br /> <br /> 3) Why does the Slug Thrower Rifle &amp; Pistol have a variable rating for its enhancement rating? I don't see anything that should adjust it, as the variable ammo doesn't?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1635,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","user":"Citadel97501","date":".  Can't change the title but I had more questions? 02-06-2020, 04:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:34:26-08:00","id":1365860,"title":"","content":"1) Not a specialist, you probably know better, but I think not all automatic weapons have enough shooting rating to properly spray. An automatic hand weapon or assault rifle probably would not be really useful as a spray weapon, as the bullets will be too far form each other. That\u2019s my guess.<br /> <br /> Another point is, spray tag (as I see) is more like a flamethrower than a machine gun.<br /> <br /> 2) Quality 2 gives Enhancement 2 not +2 enhancements, same for Quality 3, gives Enhancement 3 not +3 enhancement.<br /> <br /> 3) It can use different ammunition, with Quality 2 or Quality 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:40:49-08:00","id":1365862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1365819-automatic-weapons-and-spray?p=1365860#post1365860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Not a specialist, you probably know better, but I think not all automatic weapons have enough shooting rating to properly spray. An automatic hand weapon or assault rifle probably would not be really useful as a spray weapon, as the bullets will be too far form each other. That\u2019s my guess.<br /> <br /> Another point is, spray tag (as I see) is more like a flamethrower than a machine gun.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is a solid point. I was thinking something more like the moronic Rambo or Predator style weapon useage. (Standing in the open and just spraying down an area, hoping no one just shoots you from behind cover...this also makes sense for the -1 to defense.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2) Quality 2 gives Enhancement 2 not +2 enhancements, same for Quality 3, gives Enhancement 3 not +3 enhancement. </div> </div> </div>Ah thank you that makes more sense, I thought you would just add all the enhancement for the weapon at one time so a quality tag would be +2 enhancement.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3) It can use different ammunition, with Quality 2 or Quality 3. </div> </div> </div>OK that makes sense, but then how does that work with a quality weapon or would it stack IE a Quality weapon with Variable Ammo?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:54:06-08:00","id":1365866,"title":"","content":"Automatic Weapons get a bonus that is different than the Spray Stunt, they have access to the Emptying the Magazine stunt (TC: Core p. 105).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:19:31-08:00","id":1365880,"title":"","content":"It gets the best of the 2 tags (quality 2 from the weapon or 3 from the ammunition).<br /> <br /> The enhancement 4 would be Quality 4 + Charge or some other tag that add +1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T11:39:39-08:00","id":1366078,"title":"","content":"Dumb Rambo Spray and Pray is more like attacking multiple targets and using the Pin Down stunt on all of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}